-- a bijection of a finite model commuting with `x □ y = if (M.op a b) = (M.op b b) then (M.op a a) else if (M.op a a) = (M.op a b) then (M.op b b) else (M.op a b)` is an automorphism of `◇` --
is `GuardAut2_pxy_pyy_pxx_pxy_pxx_pyy_pxy_Equation3930`, proved elsewhere.  That obligation names no target, so every
law the companion satisfies is another cell for free, and there
are 4 of them below.
